{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B3.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"旧日的日常琐事使失去重新变得真切，沉重引子因而阴冷地闪回，却不再像最初那样郑重召唤；低声荒凉被硬生生划开，力量又很快退去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.2\", \"B1.3\", \"B2.1\", \"B2.2\", \"B3.1\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"声音短暂落稳后又向高处漂散，同一扇门从另一面显现，而真正向前的步伐仍未聚起；215小节的短促惊跳划过这一瞬，熟悉的无措再次浮现，但这一次他知道自己正在失去什么，最初的问题仍没有简单答案。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"B1中沉重引子的再次闪回、稳定感消散与同一扇门从另一面显现，使旧日的失去重新进入当下；B2则把熟悉的茫然具体化为重新遇见曾经无措的自己，而这一次他知道自己经历过什么、正在失去什么，因此最初的问题虽再次浮现，却仍没有简单答案。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B3\",\n      \"why\": \"B3.1的短促惊跳与B3.2的低声荒凉被划开后迅速退去，描述的是具体的声响和演奏效果；S09-1能够说明这些声音所处的失去与茫然的心理背景，却没有直接解释这些演奏效果为何产生。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "88fa38b0-e2b8-4d45-be92-836c25d6e1ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T064631952506Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.719, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T06:47:44.679661+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a35e9946fc7208dcaa6f7eb981aa10dd3fb5aa7b93017f7c1635e8c93a4baee", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "bro